CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1788242057
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AAmazon rigged billions in ad pricing,
OL,4,Alawsuit from states and US watchdog
OL,5,Aalleges
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Amazon overrides and replaces the
OL,8,Factual auction results with higher
OL,9,Fprices set by Amazon to increase its
OL,10,Fprofits," says a complaint filed in the
OL,11,Fcompany's home state of Washington.
OL,13,FIn a statement to the BBC, Amazon
OL,14,F"strongly disagrees" with the premise
OL,15,Fthat it misled advertisers and called
OL,16,Fthe suit "misguided."
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
