OL,3,AEx-gang boss found guilty in 1996
OL,4,Amurder of rapper Tupac Shakur
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer gang boss Duane "Keffe D" Davis
OL,7,Fhas been found guilty of orchestrating
OL,8,Fthe murder of Tupac Shakur - the first
OL,9,Fconviction in a cold case that has
OL,10,Fintrigued hip-hop fans for nearly 30
OL,11,Fyears.
OL,13,FThe jury found Davis guilty of one
OL,14,Fcount of murder with a deadly weapon
OL,15,Ffor the rap superstar's death in a
OL,16,Fdrive-by shooting in Las Vegas on 7
OL,17,FSeptember 1996.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
