OL,3,AFestival honouring Dolly Parton set for
OL,4,ANashville and London
OL,5,
OL,6,FDolly Parton's estate has announced a
OL,7,Ffestival honouring the life and legacy
OL,8,Fof the late singer, set for London and
OL,9,FNashville.
OL,11,FThe "star-studded" two-day DollyFest
OL,12,Fwill happen across two consecutive
OL,13,Fweekends in both cities in 2027, her
OL,14,Festate said in a Monday press release,
OL,15,Fadding that the specific dates will be
OL,16,Fannounced later.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11913
SC,0013
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1788242057
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFestival honouring Dolly Parton set for
OL,4,ANashville and London
OL,5,
OL,6,FParton herself dreamed up an earlier
OL,7,Fversion of the event, where she would
OL,8,Fhost and perform alongside other
OL,9,Fartists, but the original January 2026
OL,10,Fevent was called off before it was
OL,11,Fannounced publicly, due to Parton's
OL,12,Fhealth struggles, her estate said.
OL,14,F"DOLLYFEST will be the party of a
OL,15,Flifetime she wanted to share with the
OL,16,Fworld," her estate said.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
