OL,3,AJohn Galliano exhibition at New York
OL,4,AMet cancelled after backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Galliano has cancelled an upcoming
OL,7,Fmajor exhibition celebrating his work
OL,8,Fas a fashion designer after it prompted
OL,9,Fcriticism due to his previous
OL,10,Fconviction for making antisemitic
OL,11,Fremarks.
OL,13,FThe Metropolitan Museum of Art in New
OL,14,FYork had announced an exhibition titled
OL,15,FJohn Galliano: Horizons that was due to
OL,16,Fopen in May 2027.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11915
SC,0015
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1788242057
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AJohn Galliano exhibition at New York
OL,4,AMet cancelled after backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Galliano said on Monday: "After
OL,7,Fmuch reflection and discussion with the
OL,8,FMet and all those involved, I have
OL,9,Fdecided, with great sadness, that it is
OL,10,Fbest for the exhibition not to take
OL,11,Fplace at this time."
OL,13,FThe British designer was sacked as
OL,14,Fcreative director of Dior in 2011 and
OL,15,Ffound guilty of abusing a Jewish
OL,16,Fcurator in a restaurant in Paris.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
